s** against an internal expectation of \"**something around INR1,000 crores**\", because a leadership transition (outgoing MD, new MD Rajiv Malhotra on his maiden call) froze origination decisions while borrowers in \"**some gas or some oil-producing companies**\" slipped their construction schedules. The single thing that changed is **after** the quarter: July 2026 alone booked \"**more than INR1,200 crores**\" of sanctions, described as \"**the record sanction of last 13 quarters**\", against a loan book of only **INR2,946 crores**, so the whole equity case now rests on whether that sanction pipeline converts to disbursement in Q2/Q3 FY27 and carries AUM to the stated **INR5,000 crores by end of this financial year**. Strategy has been re-pointed to core infrastructure financing with a stated \"**pause on the FI and SME book**\".","trig":[]},"lm":"","m":1807,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":1,"prev_zone_vpe":null,"r":null,"s":"PFS","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"29.9","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"31.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"-0.9","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"PFS"}